{
  "label": "Spoof (/spoof): off-centre corner zoom 10-14 %, mirror on half the copies, a 1-3 degree turn left or right, small tilt/drift/speed/colour, pitch +0.7-0.8 semitone + chorus + room echo; iPhone 16 Pro Max H.264",
